Mythotoxin is a poison made from the fresh venom of a mythic creature, one that carries a strong blessing from a god or something like a god. It is rare, hard to make, and valuable. Swallowed, or taken in through a soft membrane, it can strip mythic power from whoever it touches, and it is potent enough to kill.

Two robed men in the sewers beneath [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/index|Hallia]], both now dead, each carried a dose of it sealed in a capsule set into a false back tooth, a clear liquid no different from water to look at.
